        "name": "AutoPlaylist",
        "description": "AutoPlaylist turns your Jellyfin music library into a growing set of thematic, hand-curated playlists. A local LLM served by Ollama looks at what your library actually holds, chooses an angle, then picks every track by musical judgment \u2014 no genre-filter automation. Playlists it owns are marked with a tag, so your own playlists are never touched. Runs nightly as a scheduled task.",
